@startuml
title Multi-level approval and exactly-once posting
actor Reviewer
participant ApprovalUseCase
participant Authorization
database Transaction
participant Journal
Reviewer -> ApprovalUseCase: decide(level, outcome)
ApprovalUseCase -> Authorization: eligible and not submitter?
ApprovalUseCase -> Transaction: conditional unique decision
alt rejected
 Transaction -> Transaction: finalize REJECTED; no posting
else approvals remain
 Transaction -> Transaction: retain PENDING
else all required levels approve
 Transaction -> Journal: atomically finalize + unique source posting
 Journal --> Transaction: one posting committed
end
Transaction --> ApprovalUseCase: result or conflict
ApprovalUseCase --> Reviewer: status
@enduml
